    "The Avenue Primary School, Phonics - Sounds-Write Units, for the spellings taught in each Initial Code and Extended Code unit, Reception to Year 2, which the file follows where sources differ: https://www.theavenueprimaryschool.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Phonics-Sounds-Write-Overview-of-Units.pdf",
